WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.720
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:11.010
ALYSSA GOODMAN: A lot of times when
we're talking about this PredictionX

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.940
effort in many different
venues, people say, oh, you

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.540
must be doing a lot about astrology,
because they know I'm an astronomer.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.270
And I say no, actually I
know nothing about astrology.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:26.190
But given how many people are very,
very interested in their own horoscope

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.670
today, and people have been
interested in that for generations,

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.300
we really thought it
was important to include

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.020
an expert astrologer, modern
astrologer in the course.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:40.260
Not Isaac Newton who is
an expert old astrologer.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.340
KATHLEEN MEDINA: When I think of astrology
I think it's man in astronomy.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.090
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mhm.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.531
KATHLEEN MEDINA: You know, it's this kind
of how it might affect that person.

00:00:48.531 --> 00:00:49.280
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Yeah.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.113
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Those planets
around that person.

00:00:51.113 --> 00:00:55.360
So when we look at a chart,
we are looking at the center

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.344
as if you were standing in the
center and the center is earth.

00:00:58.344 --> 00:00:59.010
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.370
KATHLEEN MEDINA: OK?

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.230
So obviously, you know, the solar
system it would be heliocentric.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:02.760
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Right.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:05.790
KATHLEEN MEDINA: But when we look at it
we're looking at from you on the earth

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.540
and what the planets are
symbolizing about you.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.040
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Is there any kind
of, like, physical connection

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:15.240
between the actual pole of
planets, for example, on a person

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.819
and what is forecast for them?

00:01:16.819 --> 00:01:18.360
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Everything's interconnect.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.050
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.466
KATHLEEN MEDINA: And so that's my sense.

00:01:20.466 --> 00:01:23.970
And that the movements do affect us.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:28.410
And, um, I'm not sure what
it is, but I can tell you

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:31.890
after years of working
with people and charts,

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:38.565
it's uncanny what a chart reveals and
what the movements of planets or stars

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:40.690
can say about the person
or what's going to happen.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:42.606
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Well you
got me very curious now.

00:01:42.606 --> 00:01:45.930
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So I'm not sure
what the exact connection.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.170
I know there's a connection.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:47.750
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.583
KATHLEEN MEDINA: You know?

00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:52.830
And from observation--
personal observation, you know.

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.800
Not just going on faith,
but that this is--

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:00.057
this is amazing, how, you know certain
things just come out over and over.

00:02:00.057 --> 00:02:01.890
ALYSSA GOODMAN: So if I
understand, a lot of it

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:08.419
is like people have done this kind of
astrology for thousands of years and--

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:09.139
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Yep.

00:02:09.139 --> 00:02:11.597
ALYSSA GOODMAN: --and I don't want
to put words in your mouth,

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:15.330
but that they just kind of learned more
and more about what kinds of things

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:19.005
you can predict from the
positions of planets.

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:19.950
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Exactly.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.806
I think a lot of this is in
some ways pattern recognition.

00:02:23.806 --> 00:02:25.680
You know, when you have
certain combinations,

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.515
certain things tend to happen.

00:02:27.515 --> 00:02:28.559
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mhm.

00:02:28.559 --> 00:02:29.350
KATHLEEN MEDINA: And it--

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.058
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Now would the same
things happen for all people born

00:02:32.058 --> 00:02:33.645
at the same time in the same place?

00:02:33.645 --> 00:02:34.800
KATHLEEN MEDINA: No.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.105
And that's what become--

00:02:36.105 --> 00:02:37.355
that's where it's interesting.

00:02:37.355 --> 00:02:37.710
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mm, OK.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:40.835
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So I was just going to say
I--I don't believe that everything is

00:02:40.835 --> 00:02:42.210
set in stone, you know.

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.970
I believe that there's
basic patterns and then

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:48.414
we have this free will to
move within these patterns.

00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:49.080
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:52.560
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So you'll see some people
with a certain configuration that's

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.469
very pronounced.

00:02:53.469 --> 00:02:56.010
And you'll go, oh that person
is going to be very successful.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:58.470
And they can do-- and maybe
that doesn't fully materialize.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.680
And they had somebody else born
on that date at that place--

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.540
place is important too--

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:06.180
at that time, which is
very important, the time.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:11.257
They may completely, you know, fulfill
that potential that we're reading--

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.090
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Got it.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:13.173
KATHLEEN MEDINA: --in the chart.

00:03:13.173 --> 00:03:18.600
Astrology, because it's so
intricate, is about the relationships

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:23.400
between that planet and the sign, which
means the part of the sky it was in.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.220
And how it's relating
to the other planets

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.650
and relating to earth
in a particular time

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.405
or particular day or particular place.

00:03:30.405 --> 00:03:33.530
ALYSSA GOODMAN: What would you say is the
balance among your clients of people

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.925
who are very seriously looking to
you for advice about, you know,

00:03:36.925 --> 00:03:39.290
business decisions and their
love life and whatever?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:43.050
And-- and then other people
who are just kind of curious

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.920
and want to have the experience
of knowing their horoscope?

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:54.360
KATHLEEN MEDINA: In my-- in my practice
I would say I'm about 80-85% more

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.050
serious--

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:55.770
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:59.767
KATHLEEN MEDINA: --guidance, and maybe
15 to 20% were of the curious.

00:03:59.767 --> 00:04:00.600
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Got it.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.120
Do you ever give people bad news?

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:06.000
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Well I don't look
at anything as bad or good.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.380
I look at it all as energy.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.814
I'll tell people what to look for.

00:04:08.814 --> 00:04:09.480
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:10.267
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Yeah.

00:04:10.267 --> 00:04:14.951
Um, I can tell when there's
going to be a lot of change.

00:04:14.951 --> 00:04:15.450
OK?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.450
I can tell when somebody's
going to go-- they're

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.165
going to need to let something big go.

00:04:19.165 --> 00:04:20.010
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mm hmm?

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:20.100
KATHLEEN MEDINA: OK?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.975
So I can tell if there's something
going on maybe with Pluto working,

00:04:22.975 --> 00:04:28.620
or Saturn aspecting Pluto, that they're
going to have to let a wave being go,

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:33.130
or there's some aspect of their
lifestyle that needs to change.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:35.400
And my feeling is--

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.140
I'm kind of an optimist anyway.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.530
But my feeling is-- is
that how I read astrology

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:45.750
is it's a way to understand
ourselves and our lives to help us.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.730
So if there are the
more difficult or you're

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:52.440
saying bad or challenging aspects, I
ultimately see it from the big picture,

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.270
is trying to help us evolve.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.190
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Given that we're talking
about this being a long tradition

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.350
and that people didn't
know Pluto was even there

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:02.265
or that it was a planet or a dwarf
planet or whatever we want to call it--

00:05:02.265 --> 00:05:03.390
KATHLEEN MEDINA: [LAUGHTER] Yeah.

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:05.422
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Something
in the solar system.

00:05:05.422 --> 00:05:10.100
Um, does it have new significance
because it exists, or?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.122
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Well I
understand your question.

00:05:12.122 --> 00:05:14.080
So yeah we didn't read
the three outer planets,

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.880
right, until the last 150 years or so.

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:23.380
And so we wouldn't have looked at
that probably as aspecting Pluto.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.360
This is your map of you.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.240
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:26.930
My universe.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.760
KATHLEEN MEDINA: This is your universe.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.790
This is giving me like a-- like a
Polaroid of what was in the sky.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:34.520
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.103
KATHLEEN MEDINA: OK.

00:05:35.103 --> 00:05:37.540
And so when you were born--

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:42.444
and we need the place, the date, but
we need the time to be really accurate.

00:05:42.444 --> 00:05:43.110
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.140
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Because, as you know,
the planets rotate in 24 hours.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:51.160
So what's coming up over the horizon
is changing every two hours, roughly.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.057
And that's called your ascendant.

00:05:53.057 --> 00:05:53.890
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mm hmm.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.800
KATHLEEN MEDINA: This sets the
tone of the whole chart.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:03.190
So what's rising in the sky is setting
the whole tone for you in terms

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.300
of how--

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.664
it's like the lens you see life through.

00:06:06.664 --> 00:06:07.330
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.620
KATHLEEN MEDINA: That's called your
ascendant or rising sign.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:10.286
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:12.940
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Your rising sign is Libra.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:17.800
And Libra is an air sign, so this
is more working with the intellect.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.900
Libra is also about balance.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.950
Libra is the scales, right?

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:23.020
So we have balance.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:24.300
We have diplomacy.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.970
It's very partnership oriented,
wanting to work together

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.720
with other people and teams.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.500
So the houses are fields of influence.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.430
In your case, 9th house
up here, top of the chart,

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:40.480
is representing higher education.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.730
It's representing developing the mind.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.440
It's represent foreign travel.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.707
It's expansion of what's
possible in the world.

00:06:46.707 --> 00:06:48.540
ALYSSA GOODMAN: So let me
back up for a second.

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:51.910
So this is about-- what--what we've
been saying is about sort of what kind

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.670
of person I might be, what
kind of personality I have.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:58.990
And then does this kind
of horoscope get more

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:01.720
specific about events that are
going to happen in the future,

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.745
or people's tendencies?

00:07:02.745 --> 00:07:03.570
KATHLEEN MEDINA: No.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.230
We can-- we do both.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:05.920
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.720
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So this is your-- your map.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.770
This is your star map.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:10.870
This is-- this is giving me a blueprint.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:13.210
This is your basic makeup, OK?

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.220
As an astrologer to look at it.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.517
This is permanent for you.

00:07:16.517 --> 00:07:17.350
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mm hmm.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.050
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So then what
we do is we can look

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:23.704
at any particular time
in a person's life.

00:07:23.704 --> 00:07:24.370
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.560
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Now when
people come to see me

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:30.730
they're usually looking at what's
going on now, or maybe this next year,

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.810
or roughly at this time.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.020
And so I do what's called a transit--

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.520
there's different things you can do.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:40.390
I do a transits chart because
it's the most literal.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:44.950
It's literally where the planets are
transiting, you know, in the orbit,

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:48.100
and how they may be
aspecting your birth chart.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:52.060
So what we do is, when
we look at predictions

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:57.250
we're looking at what is that
nature and what may be aspecting it.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.890
Maybe what is-- what is--

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.892
what's another word I can use for that?

00:08:01.892 --> 00:08:04.474
Um, what is playing on it?

00:08:04.474 --> 00:08:05.140
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.300
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So basically it's another
way of saying what's up for you.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:07.795
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:08:07.795 --> 00:08:07.960
Yeah.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:08.500
What's up for me?

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.708
KATHLEEN MEDINA: What's up for you?

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:15.250
One of the things that does jump
at me is that you've had Uran--

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.700
this is Uranus in Aries.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.730
And it's been in Aries
since about March--

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.042
the planet Uranus has been in
Aries since I think March 2011.

00:08:22.042 --> 00:08:23.500
So about seven years it's in there.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.230
It has an 84 year orbit.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:31.060
And it is working its way
through your seventh house.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.059
What that tells me, without
knowing you, is this

00:08:34.059 --> 00:08:39.076
could be very interesting,
good news for your love life.

00:08:39.076 --> 00:08:39.909
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Mm hmm.

00:08:39.909 --> 00:08:43.419
KATHLEEN MEDINA: And because
Uranus in Aries is--

00:08:43.419 --> 00:08:46.801
is wanting to-- Uranus is,
we call it, the awakener.

00:08:46.801 --> 00:08:47.300
OK.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:51.070
We call it the awakener
or the rejuvenator.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:51.940
And it's an Aries.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.397
It's like wanting new
energy, new action.

00:08:54.397 --> 00:08:55.480
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Sounds great.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:59.410
I have a lot of decisions to make
about how many long trips to go on, um,

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:01.120
in the next six months or so.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:01.780
KATHLEEN MEDINA: OK.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:06.700
ALYSSA GOODMAN: And it could be anywhere
from about three to about six.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.940
And six seems like kind of too much.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:12.850
And is there any reason I should go
on every trip that I could go on?

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:17.410
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So I can see that more
opportunities are coming to you.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.640
I mean, no question.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.450
And there's-- and travel
would be one of them.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.740
However, you don't have to take
everything that comes along.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:32.170
And-- and there is more of a
relaxing into some of this.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.590
And you're-- here's one thing
I'm going to tell you for sure--

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.324
Is you need to trust
your intuition more.

00:09:38.324 --> 00:09:40.490
And I'm not just saying
that as a blanket statement.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:41.890
I'm saying that to you.

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:45.130
Because you have planets
lining up in such a way

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:49.540
that are suggesting that your
intuition is opening even more.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:52.584
This could even indicate
like a spiritual opening.

00:09:52.584 --> 00:09:53.250
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:56.830
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Some sort of-- you know--
it could be through religious study,

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:58.630
it could be through an experience.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.360
But it's a spiritual opening.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.440
It's an opening in that consciousness.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:05.200
This is indicating a lot of intuition.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.876
You already are extremely intuitive
based on your birth chart.

00:10:07.876 --> 00:10:09.375
This is tied to the travel question.

00:10:09.375 --> 00:10:09.890
ALYSSA GOODMAN: OK.

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:10.723
What does that mean?

00:10:10.723 --> 00:10:13.670
KATHLEEN MEDINA: So this is--

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.845
I'm not going to say taking it easier--

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.520
let me find the words for you--

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.245
ALYSSA GOODMAN: More time at the spa?

00:10:24.245 --> 00:10:24.870
KATHLEEN MEDINA: Yes.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:25.320
ALYSSA GOODMAN: Oh excellent.

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:25.690
KATHLEEN MEDINA: And you know--
you know, honestly, I don't--

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.850
I don't--

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:29.020
[MUSIC PLAYING]

